{
  "version": 1,
  "source_hash": 6024223466842693627,
  "segments": [
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "vDSO: Virtual Dynamic Shared Object",
      "source_hash": 12868310545019920162,
      "context_hash": 8646316095611543774,
      "translation": "vDSO: Virtual Dynamic Shared Object",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647132Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:0/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Syscalls without entering the kernel: gettimeofday at userspace speed",
      "source_hash": 2003123973476374777,
      "context_hash": 14458612251452168181,
      "translation": "커널에 진입하지 않는 시스템 콜: 사용자 공간 속도의 gettimeofday",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647133Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The problem",
      "source_hash": 2326415031189538800,
      "context_hash": 132814444315435952,
      "translation": "문제",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "The problem": "문제"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T23:30:13.117611Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "Every system call requires a mode switch: user → kernel → user.",
      "source_hash": 13328394415263431880,
      "context_hash": 4905604041367210443,
      "translation": "모든 시스템 콜에는 모드 전환(사용자 → 커널 → 사용자)이 필요합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "system call": "시스템 콜"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647133Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "For `gettimeofday()`, this means:",
      "source_hash": 3309592398938129971,
      "context_hash": 15894683412237008763,
      "translation": "`gettimeofday()`의 경우 이는 다음을 의미합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Save registers, change privilege level (CPL 0)",
      "source_hash": 10182763878599276885,
      "context_hash": 9311527700986392241,
      "translation": "레지스터 저장, 특권 레벨 변경(CPL 0)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Look up time in the kernel",
      "source_hash": 15259908060613902056,
      "context_hash": 14377552065439527676,
      "translation": "커널에서 시간 조회",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Restore registers, return to userspace",
      "source_hash": 5972254302950756466,
      "context_hash": 585045732992203855,
      "translation": "레지스터 복원, 사용자 공간으로 복귀",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:0",
      "source": "For high-frequency time queries (trading systems, profilers, game loops), this round-trip costs ~100-300ns.",
      "source_hash": 4804159368208116601,
      "context_hash": 8597673857675719288,
      "translation": "고빈도 시간 조회(트레이딩 시스템, 프로파일러, 게임 루프)에서 이 왕복 비용은 ~100-300ns입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:1/block:5/seg:1",
      "source": "The vDSO eliminates it.",
      "source_hash": 8451319258356647604,
      "context_hash": 3769860026112076998,
      "translation": "vDSO는 이 비용을 없앱니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "What is the vDSO?",
      "source_hash": 8971617460570945303,
      "context_hash": 3132637379989398586,
      "translation": "vDSO란 무엇인가",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647134Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The vDSO (virtual dynamic shared object) is a small shared library that the kernel **maps into every process address space** automatically.",
      "source_hash": 15067913973938558359,
      "context_hash": 9604381800518915321,
      "translation": "vDSO(virtual dynamic shared object)는 커널이 자동으로 **모든 프로세스 주소 공간에 매핑하는** 작은 공유 라이브러리입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "Process Address Space": "프로세스 주소 공간",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:2/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "It contains a few time-related functions implemented as pure userspace code that read from a kernel-maintained shared memory region — no syscall needed.",
      "source_hash": 12360750427678667825,
      "context_hash": 7516737977010045268,
      "translation": "vDSO에는 커널이 관리하는 공유 메모리 영역을 읽는 순수 사용자 공간 코드로 구현된 몇 가지 시간 관련 함수가 들어 있으며, 시스템 콜이 필요하지 않습니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "functions": "함수",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "shared memory": "공유 메모리",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "userspace": "사용자 공간"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:3/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Functions in the vDSO",
      "source_hash": 17894135842284340156,
      "context_hash": 1088434795234808764,
      "translation": "vDSO의 함수",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "functions": "함수",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The vdso_data shared page",
      "source_hash": 11966847429373053240,
      "context_hash": 723818224767070962,
      "translation": "vdso_data 공유 페이지",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel maintains a **vvar** (vDSO variable) page that is:",
      "source_hash": 9949344323432172222,
      "context_hash": 16979400874068261424,
      "translation": "커널은 다음과 같은 **vvar**(vDSO variable) 페이지를 관리합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:2/seg:0",
      "source": "Mapped read-only into every process",
      "source_hash": 2379422330217395830,
      "context_hash": 7394634530566573583,
      "translation": "모든 프로세스에 읽기 전용으로 매핑됨",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "process": "프로세스"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:3/seg:0",
      "source": "Written by the kernel (holding current time)",
      "source_hash": 7318875264718328498,
      "context_hash": 17893374751248612732,
      "translation": "커널이 기록함(현재 시간 보관)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:4/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "Read by the vDSO functions (no syscall)",
      "source_hash": 10521256485544063715,
      "context_hash": 7625363221587577349,
      "translation": "vDSO 함수가 읽음(시스템 콜 없음)",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "functions": "함수",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647135Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "The seqlock pattern",
      "source_hash": 8606038130275674719,
      "context_hash": 2965194377053615740,
      "translation": "seqlock 패턴",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seqlock": "seqlock"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel updates `vdso_data` while user code reads it concurrently.",
      "source_hash": 14724288731500037366,
      "context_hash": 44389291920432238,
      "translation": "커널은 사용자 코드가 `vdso_data`를 동시에 읽는 동안 이를 갱신합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:1/seg:1",
      "source": "A **seqlock** ensures consistent reads:",
      "source_hash": 15119903649222631165,
      "context_hash": 1490486319670321150,
      "translation": "**seqlock**은 일관된 읽기를 보장합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "seqlock": "seqlock"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:0",
      "source": "The retry loop is the key: if the kernel updated `vdso_data` during our read (seq changed), we retry.",
      "source_hash": 6705579629653217451,
      "context_hash": 2350828591272354219,
      "translation": "핵심은 재시도 루프입니다. 읽는 도중에 커널이 `vdso_data`를 갱신했다면(seq가 바뀌었다면) 다시 시도합니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "kernel": "커널"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:5/block:4/seg:1",
      "source": "Typically 0 retries.",
      "source_hash": 16231606657854808572,
      "context_hash": 10731692445765766045,
      "translation": "일반적으로 재시도 횟수는 0회입니다.",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "AT_SYSINFO_EHDR: finding the vDSO",
      "source_hash": 14375166067790460165,
      "context_hash": 6379872042947746395,
      "translation": "AT_SYSINFO_EHDR: vDSO 찾기",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:6/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The kernel passes the vDSO address via the ELF auxiliary vector:",
      "source_hash": 5391537123399774735,
      "context_hash": 7494990462772317546,
      "translation": "커널은 ELF 보조 벡터(auxiliary vector)를 통해 vDSO 주소를 전달합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "ELF": "ELF",
        "address": "주소",
        "kernel": "커널",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "vDSO fallback to syscall",
      "source_hash": 17395199567061700275,
      "context_hash": 4323156546789273036,
      "translation": "vDSO의 시스템 콜 폴백",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "fallback": "폴백",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:7/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "If the vDSO can't provide the answer (e.g., clock is not TSC-based, or it's a non-monotonic clock), it falls back to a real syscall:",
      "source_hash": 16466716569801531859,
      "context_hash": 2390408191482305693,
      "translation": "vDSO가 답을 제공할 수 없는 경우(예: 클럭이 TSC 기반이 아니거나 non-monotonic 클럭인 경우) 실제 시스템 콜로 폴백합니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "TSC": "TSC",
        "syscall": "시스템 콜",
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647136Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:8/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "Performance comparison",
      "source_hash": 1863840401554524125,
      "context_hash": 13446045798874129603,
      "translation": "성능 비교",
      "glossary_snapshot": {},
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647137Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:0/seg:0",
      "source": "vDSO on other architectures",
      "source_hash": 2768257723933507103,
      "context_hash": 2355339306267614950,
      "translation": "다른 아키텍처의 vDSO",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647137Z",
      "issues": []
    },
    {
      "id": "section:9/block:1/seg:0",
      "source": "The vDSO is architecture-specific:",
      "source_hash": 6870490955836042647,
      "context_hash": 14621806582963928696,
      "translation": "vDSO는 아키텍처마다 다릅니다:",
      "glossary_snapshot": {
        "vDSO": "vDSO"
      },
      "translated_at": "2026-11-14T22:24:29.647137Z",
      "issues": []
    },
